# Private, per-deployment, and secret material never belongs in the repo.
# Only generic, shareable structure is committed here (see infra/README.md).

# Private material, and the GENERATED inventory.
#
# inventory/hosts.ini is produced from infra/fleet.yml by scripts/dev/fleet.py
# on every `just infra::*` run, so committing it would be committing a second,
# staler copy of the declaration. The committed half is
# inventory/host_vars/: structural facts about a machine (where its runner
# tree lives, which pools CI must avoid), never a capacity knob.
ansible/private/
ansible/inventory/*.ini
ansible/group_vars/*.yml
!ansible/group_vars/*.example.yml

# Terraform state, provider caches, and real variable values.
**/.terraform/
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*
**/*.tfvars
!**/*.tfvars.example
**/.terraform.lock.hcl

# Any secret that slips through despite OpenBao being the intended store.
*.pem
*.key
*_token
*.pat
*.secret
